## Food and drink

- eat plenty of vegetables, fruit, wholegrains, beans and fish
- cut down on **sugary drinks**, sweets, cakes and processed foods
- choose healthier fats, such as olive oil and nuts
- **coffee** may have a protective effect on the liver

## Move more

Walking, cycling, swimming or strength exercises all help. Find something you enjoy.

## Alcohol

Keep within **14 units a week** spread over several days, or stop, as your doctor advises.

## Avoid unnecessary medicines and supplements

Check with a pharmacist before taking herbal remedies or supplements.

## Support

The **British Liver Trust** has a free helpline and an online liver health check.
